RegistrationChallengeService ..> JdbcTemplate
RegistrationChallengeService ..> VerificationCodeHasher
RegistrationChallengeService ..> RegistrationChallengeService_VerificationChallenge
RegistrationChallengeService ..> UserIdentity
RegistrationChallengeService ..> EmailVerificationCode
RegistrationChallengeService ..> UserAccount
